# Windows Forensic Triage Workbench

This project performs read-only triage of an authorized Windows evidence working directory.

It:
- enumerates regular files;
- computes SHA-256;
- records size and runtime-visible timestamps;
- identifies duplicate content by digest;
- writes JSON/CSV reports outside the evidence directory.

It does not:
- acquire a disk image;
- parse NTFS internals;
- recover deleted data;
- parse Registry/EVTX/Prefetch directly;
- acquire memory;
- establish human attribution or intent.
